BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:anafi-chora-feast-of-agios-nikolaos-chora-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20271205
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20271207
SUMMARY:Feast of Agios Nikolaos\, Chora
LOCATION:Chora\, Anafi\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Anafi's patron saint has his church on the main square of Chora and the island keeps his day\, 6 December\, with a liturgy and a formal communal meal organised by the cultural association. It's a residents' winter feast — a handful of visitors at most — and reaching the island in December depends on the weekly Santorini boat and the weather.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/anafi/#chora-feast-of-agios-nikolaos-chora
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/anafi/#chora-feast-of-agios-nikolaos-chora
END:VEVENT
